WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.164 --> 00:00:10.589
In tutorial 7.3, you'll track where
your keywords rank, every week,

00:00:10.639 --> 00:00:12.233
and spot the biggest moves.

00:00:13.273 --> 00:00:17.963
First, open Rankings. The top shows how
many keywords are checked each week,

00:00:18.013 --> 00:00:20.890
how many reach the top
10, and how they moved.

00:00:21.843 --> 00:00:26.583
Below, Where your keywords rank groups
them by position, from the top 3 down.

00:00:27.864 --> 00:00:31.539
Then Position history charts
each keyword week by week.

00:00:31.589 --> 00:00:34.292
Use Add a keyword to put
another one on the chart.

00:00:36.414 --> 00:00:40.764
Next, Biggest moves shows the keywords
that moved the most since the last weekly

00:00:40.814 --> 00:00:41.469
check.

00:00:42.864 --> 00:00:47.164
Below, each keyword ladder lists
its pages and where they rank.

00:00:47.214 --> 00:00:50.892
Click the history button beside
a keyword to open its details.

00:00:51.886 --> 00:00:55.111
You see where it ranks on a
phone, your share of voice,

00:00:55.161 --> 00:00:58.527
meaning your estimated share of the
clicks, and who ranks above you.

00:01:00.929 --> 00:01:04.569
Finally, Tracked site keywords
lists the other keywords you watch,

00:01:04.619 --> 00:01:08.762
with what the results page shows.
Click Edit keywords to add more.

00:01:09.886 --> 00:01:14.811
Type one under Other keywords to watch.
Its position is checked every week,

00:01:14.861 --> 00:01:16.741
without pages being written for it.

00:01:17.886 --> 00:01:22.842
Then click the save button. It sends a
fresh report, and uses about 6 credits.

00:01:24.411 --> 00:01:27.086
Now you see where every
keyword stands each week,

00:01:27.136 --> 00:01:29.086
and which moves are worth acting on.

00:01:30.907 --> 00:01:35.917
So, check the top 10, follow positions
over time, read the biggest moves,

00:01:35.967 --> 00:01:39.173
open a keyword's details,
and add keywords to track.

00:01:40.177 --> 00:01:45.922
Your rankings are covered. Next, act on
your recommendations in tutorial 7.4.
